behaviour BEH-BOOTSTRAP-1 "A new learner starts with the ten most common words, and gets that starter set only once"
  source inferred backend/Balenthiran.LanguageVocab.Tests/PoolServiceTests.cs:Bootstrap_creates_first_ten_by_rank
