  contract fewer than ten available takes all of them
  contract his question (language-vocab.notes.md#2026-10-29-1332), "What sites this man": the first time you drill, the app picks the ten most common HSK1 words for you to practise (your "pool"), and never hands out a second starter set

behaviour BEH-UNLOCK-2 "Once you know your words well, the next five most common words join, until none are left"
  source inferred backend/Balenthiran.LanguageVocab.Tests/PoolServiceTests.cs:TryUnlock_adds_next_batch_by_rank_when_mastered
  priority 4
  review unreviewed
  serves BEH-POOL-MVP
  contract his question (language-vocab.notes.md#2026-10-29-1332), "What does this mean": each word has a strength from 0 to 5; when the average across your words reaches 3.5, the next five most common words are added, and once all 150 are in nothing more is added

